Diode Collab v1.21.0 was released on July 9, 2026.

* Features
  * Add chat sync status information to banner
  * Allow signup even if some BNS registration chains are unavailable
  * Auto-join Diode Collab fleet for bandwidth sponsorship
* Bug fixes:
  * Direct connects via LAN

## Add chat sync status information to banner

Chat sync status information is now shown visibly in a banner above the chat when the device's chat history is catching up to Zone state.

